          "x": -420,
          "y": 0,
          "values": {},
          "props": {
            "text": "Sound Analyser listens to your default audio input.\n\nLow frequencies drive the ring size, the beat trigger picks a random hue, and the overall level drives the glow.\n\nIf nothing moves, check the input level and raise Gain.",
